'''Creeping Ice''' is a [[tempest]]-like environmental [[debuff]] in [[Veritania, the Redeemer|The Redeemer]]-influenced map. It is a type of [[Cold Snap ground]].

It can also be found in the boss arena of {{il|Dark Forest Map}}, or {{il|Wereclaw Talisman}} possessed monster.

The area effect move around and then disappear after a while for The Redeemer and Dark Forest Map versions.

==Trivia==
Creeping Ice shared the same status icon with [[frozen ground]].

